---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '../components/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'May 28, 2026';
const contactEmail  = 'hello@floridahometips.com';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Florida Home Tips"
  description="Florida Home Tips privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <BreadcrumbSchema
    crumbs={[
      { name: 'Home',           url: new URL('/', Astro.site).toString() },
      { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: new URL('/privacy-policy', Astro.site).toString() },
    ]}
  />

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="bg-dark-blue py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-montserrat font-extrabold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-sm">Effective date: {effectiveDate}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Policy content -->
  <article class="bg-white py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-montserrat prose-headings:text-dark-blue prose-a:text-vivid-cyan prose-strong:text-dark-blue">

      <p>
        Florida Home Tips ("we," "us," or "our") operates the website <strong>floridahometips.com</strong>. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit our site or subscribe to our email list.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Information you provide directly</h3>
      <p>
        When you subscribe to our email list through a Kit (ConvertKit) form, you provide your email address and optionally your first name. We use this information solely to send you the requested content (such as the Florida Home Maintenance Checklist) and occasional email updates related to Florida home maintenance.
      </p>

      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>
        When you visit our site, our web host and analytics tools may automatically collect standard log data, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and pages visited. This data is used in aggregate to understand how visitors use our site and improve our content.
      </p>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>
        Our site may use cookies to improve your browsing experience. You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent. If you do not accept cookies, some portions of our site may not function properly.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Deliver requested content (such as the Florida Home Maintenance Checklist PDF)</li>
        <li>Send periodic email updates about Florida home maintenance topics</li>
        <li>Analyze aggregate site usage to improve content and user experience</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>

      <h3>Kit (ConvertKit)</h3>
      <p>
        We use Kit (formerly ConvertKit) to manage our email list and deliver newsletters. When you subscribe, your email address and name are stored in Kit's systems. Kit's privacy policy is available at <a href="https://convertkit.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">convertkit.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>Google Fonts</h3>
      <p>
        Our website loads fonts from Google Fonts, which may collect your IP address when fonts are requested. Google's privacy policy is available at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We may use web analytics services to understand site traffic and usage patterns. Any analytics data collected is anonymized where possible and used only to improve our content.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Florida Home Tips participates in affiliate marketing programs, including the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program. When you click an affiliate link and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial recommendations — we only link to products we believe are genuinely useful for Florida homeowners.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Email Communications</h2>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to our email list, you may unsubscribe at any time by clicking the "unsubscribe" link at the bottom of any email we send. We will promptly remove you from our list. We do not send unsolicited commercial email.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain email subscriber information for as long as you remain subscribed. Upon unsubscribing, your information is removed from our active mailing list. Server logs are retained for a limited period for security and diagnostic purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected information from a child, please contact us so we can delete it promptly.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Florida Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Florida residents may have additional rights under the Florida Information Protection Act (FIPA) and other applicable state laws regarding access to, correction of, and deletion of personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us at the email address below.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the effective date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy periodically. Continued use of our site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, or would like to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Florida Home Tips</strong><br />
        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
